OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor stands firm on A46
OL,4,Abridge budget-reveal
OL,5,
OL,6,FRevealing the increased cost of a
OL,7,Fproject to build the so-called "bridge
OL,8,Fto nowhere" over the A46 in
OL,9,FWarwickshire was the right thing to do,
OL,10,Fthe councillor in charge has said.
OL,12,FStephen Shaw, Reform UK portfolio
OL,13,Fholder for transport and planning at
OL,14,FWarwickshire County Council, told BBC
OL,15,FCWR's Lorna Bailey the Stoneleigh
OL,16,FJunction near Kenilworth would cost
OL,17,F"below #80m".
OL,19,FThe revelation comes after construction
OL,20,Ffor the project - originally due to
OL,21,Fcost #38m - restarted following a
OL,22,Fthree-year suspension.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
